---
const items = [
  {
    q: 'Is Slide ready to use?',
    a: "Not fully yet. We're piloting in Rwanda now and building alongside those teams. Join the pilot and you'll use Slide while it's still taking shape, and what you tell us shapes what we build next.",
  },
  {
    q: 'Where is Slide available?',
    a: 'Rwanda first. We plan to open in more countries, and where we go next depends on who asks. Tell us where your team is.',
  },
  {
    q: 'What do we need to get started?',
    a: 'A computer, a headset and an internet connection. There is no phone hardware to buy or install.',
  },
  {
    q: 'Can we keep our current phones and numbers?',
    a: "Slide is built to sit alongside what you already have, so nothing has to change overnight. We'll go through your numbers and phone provider with you before you commit to anything.",
  },
  {
    q: 'What about recording and privacy?',
    a: 'Recording is opt-in per number, and callers hear a notice first. Recordings are encrypted, and the links to play them expire. The Security page has the details, including what we have not done yet.',
  },
  {
    q: 'Who is it for?',
    a: 'Teams whose work is the phone: customer care, collections, appointment lines, outsourced answering. If calls come in and someone has to pick up, it fits.',
  },
  {
    q: 'How much does it cost?',
    a: "Per agent, per month, with plans for different team sizes. We're setting prices with our first teams, so we can't quote one yet.",
  },
];
---

<section class="faq section" id="faq">
  <div class="container wrap">
    <header class="head reveal">
      <p class="kicker">Questions</p>
      <h2 class="h2">
        Questions teams <span class="soft">ask first.</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="lede">
        Something missing? <a href="/contact">Ask us directly</a>.
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="list">
      {items.map((it, i) => (
        <details class="reveal" style={`--i: ${i % 3}`}>
          <summary>
            <span>{it.q}</span>
            <svg
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="1.8"
              stroke-linecap="round"
              aria-hidden="true"
            >
              <path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path>
            </svg>
          </summary>
          <p>{it.a}</p>
        </details>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .wrap {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 0.8fr 1.2fr;
    gap: clamp(32px, 6vw, 96px);
    align-items: start;
  }
  .head {
    position: sticky;
    top: 112px;
  }
  .head .h2 {
    margin-top: 16px;
    font-size: var(--text-3xl);
  }
  .head .lede {
    margin-top: 20px;
  }
  .head .lede a {
    color: var(--ink);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-decoration-color: var(--line-strong);
    text-underline-offset: 4px;
  }
  .head .lede a:hover {
    text-decoration-color: var(--orange);
  }
  details {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  details:last-child {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  summary {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 24px;
    padding: 24px 4px;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    font-weight: 560;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }
  summary::-webkit-details-marker {
    display: none;
  }
  summary svg {
    flex: none;
    width: 20px;
    height: 20px;
    color: var(--ink-3);
    transition: transform var(--dur-base) var(--ease-out);
  }
  details[open] summary svg {
    transform: rotate(45deg);
    color: var(--orange);
  }
  details p {
    padding: 0 48px 26px 4px;
    max-width: 58ch;
    color: var(--ink-2);
  }
  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .wrap {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .head {
      position: static;
    }
  }
</style>
